                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a10de43c-2b07-3dd9-91e8-2f6d7832d084",
                        "entry_id": "3a504bd8-f7a2-3364-b569-50327bd3381b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "kind of long garment"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72007578-6a0c-4099-a71d-2d8466a3dc34",
                                "sense_id": "a10de43c-2b07-3dd9-91e8-2f6d7832d084",
                                "text": "Доро́гой я успе́л заме́тить, что спи́нка дро́жек была́ оби́та кусо́чком зеленова́тенькой мате́рии, из кото́рой был и армя́к изво́зчика; э́то обстоя́тельство почему́-то успоко́ило меня́, и я уже́ не боя́лся, что изво́зчик завезёт меня́ в глухо́й переу́лок и огра́бит.",
                                "translation": "…I noticed that the back of the drozhki was covered with a strip of the same greenish material as that of which his coat was made. For some reason or another this reassured me, and I no longer felt nervous of being taken to a quiet spot and robbed.",
                                "english": "…I noticed that the back of the drozhki was covered with a strip of the same greenish material as that of which his coat was made. For some reason or another this reassured me, and I no longer felt nervous of being taken to a quiet spot and robbed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
